WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:06.120
Doctors around the world use these endoscopy
devices to operate on damaged knees -

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.660
a high tech medical tool made by Rudolf Medical
company in Tuttlingen.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:16.260
Yvonne Glienke heads a company that helps
promote the regional medtech cluster.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.880
She scouts for new markets and makes contacts.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.160
One challenge is the US market under President
Donald Trump.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:28.700
"The companies here are taking the trade barriers
in stride that Trump wants to put in their way."

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:34.940
Some 400 companies in the Tuttlingen region
are focused on exports, and their biggest

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.900
market is the United States.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.510
The Rudolf company is among them.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.500
It uses robots to manufacture surgical instruments.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.220
These scissors have a special design. They're
rust-free and can be mass produced.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.160
More than 70 percent of them are sold abroad.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:59.820
These scissors were made by Ulrich Rudolf's
grandfather more than 100 years ago.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:03.359
Since then, the company has survived many
an economic crisis.

00:01:03.359 --> 00:01:06.730
Today Rudolf offers some 4-thousand different
products.

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:09.720
Tuttlingen supplies hospitals around the world.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:16.500
"If we stopped exporting from the Tuttlingen
area, the US would have a big problem.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.210
Blocking exports would surely backfire.

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:24.180
Technologically, the US is definitely not
at the same level as the Tuttlingen area in

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.700
terms of in-house production of medical technology."

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:36.140
200 kilometers away, the Herrenknecht company
is also focused on exports.

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:38.820
Herrenknecht builds tunnel boring machines.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:43.320
This one has just been completed and is on
its way to the Brenner Pass in Italy.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:49.100
Each tunnel boring machine is one-of-a-kind,
made to order for the customer.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.890
The US market is promising for Herrenknecht.

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:54.720
The country is in need of new roads and tunnels.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:02:00.240
But for the time being, a maximum of only
10 machines per year make it over to the US.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:08.900
Company founder Martin Herrenknecht is constantly
on the go,

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.680
visiting contruction sites around the world.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:16.840
If Trump puts up trade barriers, the specialty
machines by Herrenknecht will find use elsewhere.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:23.200
"Yesterday I flew from San Diego, changed
planes in San Francisco, and in 10 hours I

00:02:23.201 --> 00:02:24.201
was in Germany.

00:02:24.201 --> 00:02:28.000
But it's not just air travel that has made
the world really small - also

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.300
IT networks, computers and cell phones - we're
all interlinked.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:39.980
Now there's no going back, even though you
might be able to slow it down a bit.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:43.780
But whoever slows down the process loses out."

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:52.220
Back in Tuttlingen, the Rudolf company has
invited business partners from France and

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:55.160
the US to visit its production facilities.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:00.100
They're looking for new collaboration opportunities
in Germany.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:05.660
Rudolf exports to 85 countries.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:10.860
Carl Graeb travelled here from Minnesota.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:15.560
The German consultant knows the American medical
technology market inside and out.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.840
"Nobody wants protectionism.

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:25.630
There are about 700 medical technology firms
in the Minneapolis-St. Paul area - international

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:33.460
companies like 3M, Medtronic, Boston Scientific,
St. Jude - all of them operating globally.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:38.660
Not a single firm is interested in isolating
itself, either within or outside the market."

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:45.720
If Donald Trump gets his way, protectionism
would disrupt long-established business ties.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:50.800
But people are still remaining calm - at least
here in provincial Germany, where exporters

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:53.150
value good old fashioned common sense.

